OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of rape after woman's
OL,4,Aphone recording
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of raping a
OL,7,Fwoman whose mobile phone recording
OL,8,Fprovided key evidence for police.
OL,10,FAyman Al-Shammari, 28, was found guilty
OL,11,Fby a jury at Bristol Crown Court on
OL,12,FFriday after a trial.
OL,14,FThe court heard Al-Shammari and the
OL,15,Fwoman, who cannot be named for legal
OL,16,Freasons, started to have consensual sex
OL,17,Fon 14 November 2025 but he did not stop
OL,18,Fafter she asked.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
